# Frontend dependencies and build output. Every consumer — Dockerfile, CI, the
# release workflow and `make build-frontend` — runs `npm ci`, which deletes
# node_modules and reinstalls from package-lock.json, then `npm run build` to
# regenerate dist. Neither was ever read from the repository; 11,147 committed
# node_modules files were 94% of the tree, and the committed dist was stale
# output from an older build.
node_modules/
frontend/dist/

